            </button>
            <button
              type="submit"
              id="btnFinalSubmit"
              class="flex-1 sm:flex-none text-center px-4 sm:px-7 py-2.5 sm:py-3.5 bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700 text-white font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm rounded-xl transition shadow-md active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
            >
              Proses Pendaftaran &amp; Buat Invoice →
